# Vendored speexdsp

Source: https://github.com/xiph/speexdsp

Pinned to tag **SpeexDSP-1.2.1** (commit hash matches upstream 1.2.1 release).

License: BSD 3-Clause (see `COPYING`).

Only the files needed by SP#2 AEC (`mdf.c` echo canceller + `preprocess.c` noise
suppressor + kiss-fft backend + filterbank) are vendored. Resampler, jitter
buffer, SBR, and the smallft FFT path are omitted.

`speexdsp_config_types.h` is synthesized in this tree to replace the
autotools-generated file — our targets ship `<stdint.h>`, so the typedefs
resolve to the exact-width types. See the file for details.
